   "end": 446.03,
   "syl_text": 11,
   "syl_audio": 11,
   "ratio": 1.11
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "text": "Alag alag raja, alag alag morche.",
   "start": 446.36,
   "end": 448.34,
   "syl_text": 11,
   "syl_audio": 7,
   "ratio": 0.71
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "text": "Aur historian Blankinship ka ek dilchasp point: in hamlon ne hi Indian rajyon ko bada aur mazboot banne par majboor kiya.",
   "start": 448.65,
   "end": 456.01,
   "syl_text": 32,
   "syl_audio": 30,
   "ratio": 1.04
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "text": "Yahi Pratihara aage chalkar ek bada saamrajya bane, Sindh ki seema se Bengal tak.",
   "start": 456.35,
   "end": 461.51,
   "syl_text": 24,
   "syl_audio": 23,
   "ratio": 1.07
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "text": "Sau saal se zyada baad, 851 mein, Arab vyapari Sulaiman ne likha ki Gurjara raja jaisa ghudsawaar dasta kisi aur Indian raja ke paas nahi.",
   "start": 461.97,
   "end": 471.4,
   "syl_text": 47,
   "syl_audio": 42,
   "ratio": 0.99
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "text": "Ab yaad karo wo teen hazaar sainik.",
   "start": 471.73,
   "end": 473.6,
   "syl_text": 10,
   "syl_audio": 8,
   "ratio": 0.89
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "text": "Wo kahan gaye?",
   "start": 473.88,
   "end": 474.49,
   "syl_text": 4,
   "syl_audio": 4,
   "ratio": 1.11
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "text": "Iske liye India se nazar hatao, aur poora naksha dekho.",
   "start": 474.8,
   "end": 478.09,
   "syl_text": 16,
   "syl_audio": 15,
   "ratio": 1.04
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "text": "Kyunki usi waqt khilafat har taraf ek saath jal rahi thi.",
   "start": 478.37,
   "end": 481.81,
   "syl_text": 17,
   "syl_audio": 13,
   "ratio": 0.85
  },
