   "end": 597.49,
   "syl_text": 15,
   "syl_audio": 12,
   "ratio": 0.89
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "text": "Rashtrakuta raja Arab vyapariyon ko izzat dete the, aur Konkan ke bandargaahon mein masjidein bhi bani.",
